  message: "Checked and, where a defect was found, fixed in PR #2354 (dev 39bef1108).\nRE-RUN on dev 39bef1108 (pair fixtures, a/ = imported spelling, b/ = qualified spelling):\n- Objective-C: no defect. K and its methods hash alike in a and b on dev 05ed6f5fe and on 39bef1108 (untyped tier).\n- Julia: defect, fixed. f1..f4, Sub2.b, P.a, P.b, P.d, P.f: DIFFERENT on 05ed6f5fe, SAME on 39bef1108. Still DIFFERENT by design: a relative path (.Sub.Inner: X), a type parameter shadowing the import, Base.Int, a name with no import. No Julia repository is on this machine: fixture only.\n- Solidity: defect, fixed. C.f1..f4, C.m1, C.t1, C.u1: DIFFERENT, now SAME. Builder's measure: openzeppelin 155 of 4,206 ids moved.\n- TypeScript conditional type: f(x: T extends string ? Foo : Bar) against \"? Foo: Bar\" with Foo imported: DIFFERENT on 05ed6f5fe, SAME on 39bef1108. 0 ids moved on four trees.\nNOT FIXED, filed: WI-tufih-kubum-lopaz-gadul-gimof-laloz-nalal-dolid (Solidity events and parameter names), WI-zagon-fohad-zadod-gifar-jafoj-zusos-furap-balam (cross-file shadowing, sugar spellings, Julia <: bounds), a note on WI-jogih (C# global:: on a non-built-in path); Julia Base.X, Julia relative paths and Solidity address payable are put to the owner in WI-siror-bupaz-zofiz-jomam-jimim-komoh-vavad-sirar.\nEvidence: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/v19_11232026/closure/ (out_dev.txt = dev 39bef1108 after the merge, out_base.txt = dev 05ed6f5fe before it; repro trees t/, run.sh, q.py, presplit.py)."  # 31f1
